3","t":"Took an EU long had been waiting for a trade of this level for a long time.","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#163","p":7,"im":["ad1264035f1f88c1dac44149e2f0501523712fa0","a175e7a99333d9a420f0d6fd4f2ba39ceaf52bd5"],"fa":"یک خرید روی EU گرفتم؛ مدت‌ها بود منتظر معامله‌ای در این سطح بودم.","ib":{"ad1264035f1f88c1dac44149e2f0501523712fa0":1,"a175e7a99333d9a420f0d6fd4f2ba39ceaf52bd5":1},"m":163},{"id":"eurotrash_p7_164","t":"","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#164","p":7,"im":["3a2356378806557486fee131663f2abd504d5744"],"ib":{"3a2356378806557486fee131663f2abd504d5744":0},"m":164},{"id":"eurotrash_p7_165","t":"On this one entry was too early and should have exited earlier, took small loss could have exited with some pips","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#165","p":7,"im":["3b585fbb92071faec8062ddd9b9dca86c4ceb8f9"],"fa":"روی این یکی ورود زود بود و باید زودتر خارج می‌شدم؛ ضرر کوچکی خورد و می‌توانستم با چند پیپ خارج شوم","ib":{"3b585fbb92071faec8062ddd9b9dca86c4ceb8f9":1},"m":165},{"id":"eurotrash_p7_166","t":"","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#166","p":7,"im":["986445a7034071088c3f8221bc602f8853d2f3e4"],"ib":{"986445a7034071088c3f8221bc602f8853d2f3e4":0},"m":166},{"id":"eurotrash_p7_167","t":"nice trade ET,\n\nDid you see the opportunity to go long where you closed. It was a beautiful entry...wish I was there to take it.\n\nSee u tomorrow!","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#167","p":7,"im":[],"fa":"معاملهٔ قشنگی ET،\n\nآیا فرصت خرید شدن را همان‌جا که بستی دیدی؟ ورود زیبایی بود... کاش آن‌جا بودم و می‌گرفتمش.\n\nفردا می‌بینمت!","m":167},{"id":"eurotrash_p7_168","t":"This is just to remind myself that when I get p... off at news thinking it's all random this kind of thing is there to remind us that it isin't, if a level looks good, it generaly will be respected. Obviously it doesn't always go this well.","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#168","p":7,"im":["a6f44ab7ce0cd7bb8f6a3037c52eb79526a5e5e7","15b0ff859dd146776550047f33550004510a8303","4361559f2d86f391b921d49bace9fffd1cf1ce2d"],"fa":"این فقط برای یادآوری خودم است که وقتی از روی اخبار کلافه می‌شوم و فکر می‌کنم همه‌چیز رندوم است، این‌جور چیزها یادآوری می‌کنند که نیست؛ اگر سطحی خوب به نظر برسد، معمولاً به آن احترام گذاشته می‌شود. بدیهی است که همیشه این‌قدر خوب پیش نمی‌رود.","ib":{"a6f44ab7ce0cd7bb8f6a3037c52eb79526a5e5e7":1,"15b0ff859dd146776550047f33550004510a8303":1,"4361559f2d86f391b921d49bace9fffd1cf1ce2d":1},"m":168},{"id":"eurotrash_p7_169","t":"Love it. Now, just need to do this with every trade and I'll be set........","a":"rcmacf","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#169","p":7,"im":[],"fa":"دوستش دارم. حالا فقط باید همین کار را با هر معامله انجام بدهم تا درست شوم........","m":169},{"id":"eurotrash_p7_170","t":"EDIT,\n\nTook a loss on the short\n\nHave been neglecting my diary recently and performance has dropped. Plan the trade trade the plan ned to get back into it and stop being trigger happy","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#170","p":7,"im":["61813fd0d5cae48db5f27998780e812eedfc0a68"],"fa":"EDIT،\n\nروی فروش ضرر کردم\n\nاخیراً ژورنالم را غافل کرده‌ام و عملکردم افت کرده. معامله را برنامه‌ریزی کن، برنامه را معامله کن؛ باید برگردم و از عجله در ورود دست بکشم","ib":{"61813fd0d5cae48db5f27998780e812eedfc0a68":3},"m":170},{"id":"eurotrash_p7_171","t":"weekly road map","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#171","p":7,"im":["904d1efa80f91a80dbd733c58f369bae74f35d3c"],"fa":"نقشهٔ راه هفتگی","ib":{"904d1efa80f91a80dbd733c58f369bae74f35d3c":1},"m":171},{"id":"eurotrash_p7_172","t":"","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#172","p":7,"im":["ad1264035f1f88c1dac44149e2f0501523712fa0"],"ib":{"ad1264035f1f88c1dac44149e2f0501523712fa0":0},"m":172},{"id":"eurotrash_p7_173","t":"","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#173","p":7,"im":["ad1264035f1f88c1dac44149e2f0501523712fa0"],"ib":{"ad1264035f1f88c1dac44149e2f05